{"id":"n62102-3-10","stage":0,"title":"줄이다 · 减少","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62102-3-10-1","ko":"엄마, 냄비가 끓어요!","zh":"妈妈，锅里煮开了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냄비가","meaning":"小锅，汤锅，铝锅","explanation":"냄비：小锅，汤锅，铝锅；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄비","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41163","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끓어요!","meaning":"沸腾，开","explanation":"끓다：沸腾，开；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"끓다","audio":"/audio/9cc2edb7c58868d6db66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62282","senseId":"1","lemma":"끓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"61c1473461c3ddf8","term":"냄비","zh":"小锅，汤锅，铝锅","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3","entryId":"41163","definition":"煮食物时使用的器具，比铁锅小，带有盖子和手把。","pronunciation":["냄비"]},{"id":"9cc2edb7c58868d6","term":"끓다","zh":"沸腾，开","audio":"/audio/9cc2edb7c58868d6db66.mp3","entryId":"62282","definition":"液体滚烫，冒出气泡。","pronunciation":["끌타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ea1d742b92393ffae84.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62102-3-10-2","ko":"그럼 불 좀 줄여 줘.","zh":"那帮我把火调小一点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"1","lemma":"불",